# Claude-managed
.claude/.filemap.lock
docs/FILEMAP.md.bak

# Overnight orchestrator transcripts. Full `claude -p` session JSON per phase —
# prompts, tool calls, file contents, absolute paths. Never committed: this repo
# is public and nothing here passes through tools/probe/lib/redact.mjs.
.claude/overnight-logs/

